---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <article class="container about">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">About</p>
    <h1 class="reveal">I was the kid who took his <span class="mark">toys apart.<svg viewBox="0 0 200 12" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8 C 40 3, 90 11, 140 6 S 190 5, 198 7"></path></svg></span></h1>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="reveal">
        Not all of them went back together. The one I still remember was a frog-shaped calculator. I opened it up,
        found a small green PCB, and couldn't understand how something that small could do math. I'm still working on
        that question.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        In high school, everything went into the baccalaureate. University is the first time I get to spend my days on
        what I actually like, and I'm making up for lost time. My first Arduino blinked an LED. My second project was
        eight LEDs and their resistors, soldered by hand and programmed to light up in a cascade.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="facts reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="label">Studying</span>
        <span>Electronics, Telecommunications and IT, UPB (English)</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Learning</span>
        <span>C, Arduino, soldering</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Languages</span>
        <span>Romanian, English (C1), French (A2)</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Club</span>
        <span>TechForge, ETTI's IT &amp; Robotics Club</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--text-col);
    padding-top: 100px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-page-h1);
    margin: 12px 0 40px;
  }
  .body p {
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 64px;
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }
  .facts div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .facts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
